WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.406
Connect the tools you already use.

2
00:00:03.406 --> 00:00:04.891
Each one is optional.

3
00:00:05.891 --> 00:00:10.329
Connect GitHub to clone your repositories, and open pull requests.

4
00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:15.849
The hosted API speaks the OpenAI and Anthropic formats.

5
00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.314
Create an API key in Settings.

6
00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:22.013
Then call it from Cursor, servers or scripts.

7
00:00:23.013 --> 00:00:31.482
With the desktop app running, editors like Continue, Zed and Claude Code can use its local provider, right on this computer.

8
00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:37.209
For the terminal, install the command-line tool from the app's Settings.

9
00:00:37.209 --> 00:00:38.784
Then run edgecoder code.

10
00:00:39.784 --> 00:00:44.200
Type /remote in a session to keep working on it in the app.

11
00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.757
Press Next when you're done.
